    <informations>Shelly 1 Gen4 — schematic symbol.
Terminals, left to right as printed: O I SW 12V L N.

Official sources:
https://kb.shelly.cloud/knowledge-base/shelly-1-gen4
https://kb.shelly.cloud/__attachments/a_f3000f539c4f0439e4a7c1a4fec887e213e82cd233df290fe1fe0b6a0b8f9f21/Shelly%201%20Gen4.jpg?cb=078bd32268e4cf9ac56713f131888049
https://kb.shelly.cloud/__attachments/a_7cfa072bb2d0dc6f7486b92b170168c364d63b9cb02f103f7d9250bf37fff728/Plus-1-internal-schematics.png?cb=859b7ac75c9af8b5572057a91fe4196a
https://kb.shelly.cloud/__attachments/a_c9fb2bcb1a55d39c9a521f37426f00b13b019d35b9eedf6bff59743b04ef6e32/Shelly%201%20Gen4%20multilingual%20printed%20user%20and%20safety%20guide.pdf?cb=99008016d467909065c6cc94064aaabb

Notes:
- EU six terminals including separate12V; ANZ1 differs and is recorded only as a review profile. Blank pitch2.

Nominal dimensions and an illustrative outline: corner radii, screw pitch and recesses are drawn to be recognisable, not to manufacturing CAD.</informations>
